@model server.Models.Mail.CompanyRepresentativeInternshipMail

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sk">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <style>
            body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
            .container { max-width: 600px; margin: auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px; }
            .header { font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; }
            .info-box {
                padding: 15px;
                margin: 15px 0;
                background: #f4f4f4;
                border: 1px solid #ddd;
                border-radius: 6px;
            }
            .info-row { margin: 10px 0; }
            .info-label { font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; width: 150px; }
            .button {
                display: inline-block;
                padding: 12px 24px;
                margin: 20px 0;
                background: #007bff;
                color: white;
                text-decoration: none;
                border-radius: 6px;
                font-weight: bold;
            }
            .button:hover { background: #0056b3; }
            .note { font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin-top: 20px; }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">Dobrý deň, @Model.RepresentativeFirstName @Model.RepresentativeLastName!</div>

            <p>Boli ste upozornení na novú stáž v systéme <strong>InternshipManager</strong>.</p>

            <div class="info-box">
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Názov stáže:</span>
                    <span>@Model.InternshipName</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Študent:</span>
                    <span>@Model.StudentFirstName @Model.StudentLastName</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Email študenta:</span>
                    <span>@Model.StudentEmail</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p>Kliknite na tlačidlo nižšie pre zobrazenie detailov stáže a informácií o študentovi:</p>

            <a href="@Model.InternshipLink" class="button">Zobraziť detaily stáže</a>

            <p class="note">Tento odkaz je unikátny a priamo vás prevedie na formulár so všetkými potrebnými informáciami.</p>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>

